OL,3,GNEWSAFrom bridge to tunnel: The
OL,4,Abillion-pound options on the table for
OL,5,AA14
OL,6,
OL,7,FReplacing the Orwell Bridge with a
OL,8,Fcrossing or a tunnel is one of six
OL,9,Foptions being considered as a solution
OL,10,Fto traffic issues that have plagued a
OL,11,Froad network.
OL,13,FSuffolk County Council has set out the
OL,14,Ffirst phase of its plan to improve the
OL,15,FA14 transport corridor and address
OL,16,Flong-standing congestion concerns
OL,17,Faround Ipswich.
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,380,370,200,160,0,100
