OL,3,GNEWSAFrom bridge to tunnel: The
OL,4,Abillion-pound options on the table for
OL,5,AA14
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe authority is seeking permission to
OL,8,Fspend #300,000 to explore and plan
OL,9,Fpotential options ` costing up to #1bn
OL,10,F- which could help relieve pressure on
OL,11,Froads in the area.
OL,13,FReform UK councillor Christopher
OL,14,FHudson, cabinet member for transport
OL,15,Fand highways, said the issue was not
OL,16,Fjust a local concern but a "matter of
OL,17,Fnational importance".
